		(property "Description" "Philips custom op-amp back end + reference (5322 209 84444), no datasheet; pin functions INFERRED from PM2528 N31 Fig 7.40: external dual-FET input pair (drains on 15/14, tail on 16), C between 14 and 2 = compensation, 5 = output (4 linked), 6 = bias R to 0 V, 10 = ~1.23 V reference out (V.REF 1.024 V via divider), 11 = 10M to +5 V (start-up?), 12 = V+ (+5 V), 1 = V- (-7 V); pins 3,7,8,9,13 not used on N31"
